# ✅ Acceptance Checklist — scribe_pro_cleanup
**Author:** Scribe
**Version:** v0.1
**Status:** Draft
**Last Updated:** 2026-02-06 07:50:33 UTC

> Acceptance checklist for scribe_pro_cleanup.

---
## Phase 1: Immediate Cleanup
<!-- ID: phase_1 -->
- [ ] **1.1**: Root directory junk deleted (30 files removed)
  - Proof: `ls -la | wc -l` shows <15 files
- [ ] **1.2**: tmp_tests/ cleanup complete (560MB freed)
  - Proof: `du -sh tmp_tests/` returns "No such file or directory"
- [ ] **1.3**: .bak files cleaned (100+ files removed)
  - Proof: `find . -name '*.preflight-*.bak' | wc -l` returns 0
- [ ] **1.4**: .gitignore enforcement complete
  - Proof: `git status` shows no unwanted junk files tracked
- [ ] **1.5**: Documentation moved to docs/
  - Proof: Root directory contains only essential files (≤10 total)
- [ ] **Tests Pass**: `pytest` completes successfully after Phase 1

---

## Phase 2: Foundation (Logging + Security)
<!-- ID: phase_2 -->
- [ ] **2.1**: Centralized logging implemented
  - Proof: `SCRIBE_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG python -c "from scribe_mcp.config.logging import configure_logging; configure_logging()"` works
- [ ] **2.2**: All print() converted to logging (115+ sources)
  - Proof: `grep -r "print(" --include="*.py" | wc -l` returns 0 (excluding tests/)
- [ ] **2.3**: Path traversal vulnerability fixed
  - Proof: Test case `test_symlink_outside_repo_rejected()` passes
- [ ] **2.4**: Log injection vulnerability fixed
  - Proof: Test case `test_newline_log_injection()` passes
- [ ] **2.5**: Dependencies pinned
  - Proof: `requirements.txt` uses `==` for all packages
- [ ] **Tests Pass**: `pytest` completes successfully after Phase 2

---

## Phase 3: Storage Decomposition
<!-- ID: phase_3 -->
- [ ] **3.1**: storage/sqlite/ directory created with 6 modules
  - Proof: `ls -la storage/sqlite/` shows schema.py, queries.py, migrations.py, fts.py, pool.py, __init__.py
- [ ] **3.2**: Schema definitions extracted to schema.py
  - Proof: `SchemaManager.create_all_tables()` creates all 30+ tables
- [ ] **3.3**: CRUD operations extracted to queries.py
  - Proof: All 79 StorageBackend methods work via QueryManager
- [ ] **3.4**: Migration system extracted to migrations.py
  - Proof: Migrations run idempotently, scribe_migrations table tracks correctly
- [ ] **3.5**: FTS5 system extracted to fts.py
  - Proof: Full-text search on document_sections works
- [ ] **3.6**: SQLiteStorage orchestrator complete
  - Proof: All 79 methods delegate correctly to managers
- [ ] **3.7**: Imports updated across codebase
  - Proof: No import errors, all functionality preserved
- [ ] **3.8**: Original storage/sqlite.py deleted
  - Proof: File no longer exists, no references remain
- [ ] **Tests Pass**: `pytest` completes successfully after Phase 3

