## Phase 5: src/ Layout Migration + Packaging
<!-- ID: phase_5 -->
- [ ] **5.1**: pyproject.toml created
  - Proof: File exists, `python -c "import tomllib; tomllib.loads(open('pyproject.toml').read())"` parses successfully
- [ ] **5.2**: src/ directory structure created
  - Proof: `ls -la src/scribe_mcp/` shows all subpackages
