  - Proof: All 15 top-level packages present in src/scribe_mcp/
- [ ] **5.4**: Path resolutions fixed (50+ locations)
  - Proof: All imports use importlib.resources, no Path(__file__).parent.parent patterns remain
- [ ] **5.5**: Entry points updated
  - Proof: main() functions exist in server.py, scribe_cli.py, scribe_admin.py
- [ ] **5.6**: pip install works
  - Proof: `pip install -e .` succeeds, `scribe-server --help` works
- [ ] **5.7**: Package data accessible
  - Proof: Templates render, config files load
- [ ] **Tests Pass**: `pytest` completes successfully after Phase 5

