## Phase 6: Database Consolidation
<!-- ID: phase_6 -->
- [ ] **6.1**: Legacy databases audited
  - Proof: Backups exist, no unique data found in legacy DBs
- [ ] **6.2**: Hardcoded DB paths fixed
  - Proof: `grep -r ".scribe/data/scribe.db" --include="*.py" | wc -l` returns 0
- [ ] **6.3**: DB moved to XDG location
  - Proof: Database creates at `~/.local/share/scribe_mcp/scribe.db`
- [ ] **6.4**: state.json migration script created
  - Proof: `python scripts/migrate_state_json.py --dry-run` works
- [ ] **6.5**: StateManager uses database
  - Proof: StateManager reads from DB first, falls back to JSON
- [ ] **6.6**: Migration executed
  - Proof: state.json renamed to .deprecated, all state in database
- [ ] **Tests Pass**: `pytest` completes successfully after Phase 6

