  - Proof: All tables create successfully in Postgres
- [ ] **7.3**: PostgresStorage queries implemented (79 methods)
  - Proof: All CRUD operations work
- [ ] **7.4**: PostgresStorage migrations implemented
  - Proof: Migration system works, tracks in scribe_migrations table
- [ ] **7.5**: pg_trgm full-text search implemented
  - Proof: Full-text search on document_sections works
- [ ] **7.6**: asyncpg connection pooling implemented
  - Proof: Pool creates with min=2, max=10 connections
- [ ] **7.7**: SQLite → Postgres migration tool created
  - Proof: `python scripts/migrate_sqlite_to_postgres.py` migrates data successfully
- [ ] **7.8**: Postgres backend tested end-to-end
  - Proof: All tests pass with SCRIBE_STORAGE_BACKEND=postgres
- [ ] **Tests Pass**: `pytest` completes successfully after Phase 7

